cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit or its results, please cite the master's thesis it is part of (preferred citation below)."
title: "5LTEP-L2: 5L-TEP Layer 2 Semantic Policies Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, in progress, of Layer 2 (Semantic Policies) of the
  Five-Layer Trust Engineering Pyramid (5L-TEP, SOFTENG 2026) for open government
  data: domain rules defined after the data exists, one file per atomic check,
  with a human description (intention, justification, sources) and an explicit
  execution block (allowed template, exact portal, dataset, resource and
  columns), validated by a JSON Schema and cross-reference checks. The
  evaluation engine is not implemented yet. Part of the master's thesis cited
  below.
